the window averages the newest entries: (1+2+3)/3: true
reversing the log gives the mean of the other three entries, near 67.67: true
entries older than the window do not move the mean: true
a window of one is the newest entry: true
a window as long as the log is the whole-log mean: (1+2+3+4)/4: true
a window one entry longer than the log is refused: true
a window over an empty log is refused: true
a window longer than the log is refused, by however much: true
a non-positive window is refused: true
